    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1014",
      "reading_order": 1165,
      "section": "Accepted leakage rate",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00004,
        "t": 644.04184,
        "r": 147.01004,
        "b": 632.80184
      },
      "content": "Accepted leakage rate",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1015",
      "reading_order": 1166,
      "section": "Accepted leakage rate",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00004,
        "t": 629.52184,
        "r": 556.7800400000006,
        "b": 606.28184
      },
      "content": "It is not necessary to shut down or disassemble the pump to inspect the packing operation. During normal operation, the packing should leak approximately one drop per second."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1016",
      "reading_order": 1167,
      "section": "Adjustment of  gland",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00008,
        "t": 599.52184,
        "r": 141.82008000000002,
        "b": 588.28184
      },
      "content": "Adjustment of  gland",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1017",
      "reading_order": 1168,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 708.64184,
        "r": 197.11,
        "b": 697.40184
      },
      "content": "WARNING:",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1018",
      "reading_order": 1169,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 153.00002,
        "t": 694.8418399999999,
        "r": 450.03002000000015,
        "b": 683.6018399999999
      },
      "content": "Packed stuffing boxes are not allowed in an ATEX-classified environment."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1019",
      "reading_order": 1170,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 153.00004,
        "t": 681.04184,
        "r": 554.5400400000003,
        "b": 657.80184
      },
      "content": "Never attempt to replace the packing until the driver is properly locked out and the coupling spacer is removed."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1020",
      "reading_order": 1171,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00008,
        "t": 585.0018399999999,
        "r": 453.66008000000016,
        "b": 573.76184
      },
      "content": "Adjust the gland if  the leakage rate is greater than or less than the specified rate."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1021",
      "reading_order": 1172,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0001,
        "t": 570.0018399999999,
        "r": 541.0501000000002,
        "b": 546.76184
      },
      "content": "Evenly adjust each of  the two gland bolts with a one-quarter (1/4) turn until the desired leakage rate is obtained. Tighten the bolts to decrease the rate. Loosen the bolts to increase the rate."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1022",
      "reading_order": 1173,
      "section": "Tightening of  packing",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00008000000001,
        "t": 540.0018399999999,
        "r": 150.57008000000002,
        "b": 528.76184
      },
      "content": "Tightening of  packing",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1023",
      "reading_order": 1174,
      "section": "Tightening of  packing",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00008000000003,
        "t": 521.0018399999999,
        "r": 536.8100900000004,
        "b": 497.76184
      },
      "content": "NOTICE: Never over-tighten packing to the point where less than one drop per second is observed. Over-tightening can cause excessive wear and power consumption during operation."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1024",
      "reading_order": 1175,
      "section": "Tightening of  packing",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0001,
        "t": 487.48183,
        "r": 546.8001000000005,
        "b": 476.24183
      },
      "content": "If  you cannot tighten the packing to obtain less than the specified leakage rate, then replace the packing."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1025",
      "reading_order": 1176,
      "section": "Dynamic-seal maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00005,
        "t": 466.87679,
        "r": 233.73205,
        "b": 451.25279
      },
      "content": "Dynamic-seal maintenance",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
